msgid "Available %s"
msgstr "Mavjud %s"

msgid "This is the list of available %s. You may choose some by selecting them in the box below and then clicking the \"Choose\" arrow between the two boxes."
msgstr "Mavjud %s ro‘yxati. Kerakli yozuvlarni belgilang va ikki maydon orasidagi «Tanlash» tugmasini bosing."

msgid "Type into this box to filter down the list of available %s."
msgstr "Mavjud %s ro‘yxatini filtrlash uchun ushbu maydonga yozing."

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filtrlash"

msgid "Choose all"
msgstr "Barchasini tanlash"

msgid "Click to choose all %s at once."
msgstr "Barcha %s yozuvlarini birgalikda tanlash uchun bosing."

msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Tanlash"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Olib tashlash"

msgid "Chosen %s"
msgstr "Tanlangan %s"

msgid "This is the list of chosen %s. You may remove some by selecting them in the box below and then clicking the \"Remove\" arrow between the two boxes."
msgstr "Tanlangan %s ro‘yxati. Yozuvlarni tanlovdan chiqarish uchun ularni belgilang va ikki maydon orasidagi «Olib tashlash» tugmasini bosing."

msgid "Remove all"
msgstr "Barchasini tanlovdan chiqarish"

msgid "Click to remove all chosen %s at once."
msgstr "Tanlangan barcha %s yozuvlarini tanlovdan chiqarish uchun bosing."

msgid "You have unsaved changes on individual editable fields. If you run an action, your unsaved changes will be lost."
msgstr "Ayrim maydonlardagi o‘zgarishlar saqlanmagan. Amal bajarilsa, saqlanmagan o‘zgarishlar yo‘qoladi."

msgid "You have selected an action, but you haven’t saved your changes to individual fields yet. Please click OK to save. You’ll need to re-run the action."
msgstr "Amal tanlandi, ammo maydonlardagi o‘zgarishlar saqlanmagan. Saqlash uchun «OK»ni bosing. So‘ng amalni qayta bajaring."

msgid "You have selected an action, and you haven’t made any changes on individual fields. You’re probably looking for the Go button rather than the Save button."
msgstr "Amal tanlandi, maydonlar esa o‘zgartirilmadi. Tanlangan amalni bajarish uchun «Bajarish» tugmasini bosing."

